                each section-divider glyph in aria-hidden so screen readers
                don't announce "black diamond" before each category name. */}
            <span class="topic-header"><span aria-hidden="true">◆</span> Business Essentials</span>
            <a href="/guides/maine-dispensary-license">License Requirements</a>
            <a href="/guides/maine-dispensary-business-plan">Business Plan</a>
            <a href="/guides/maine-dispensary-costs">Startup Costs</a>
            <a href="/guides/maine-cannabis-market">Market Analysis</a>
            <a href="/guides/maine-cannabis-funding-guide">Funding & Capital</a>
            <a href="/guides/maine-cannabis-real-estate">Real Estate</a>
            <a href="/guides/maine-dispensary-hiring">Hiring & Staffing</a>
          </div>
          <div class="topic-group">
            <span class="topic-header"><span aria-hidden="true">◆</span> Compliance & Legal</span>
            <a href="/guides/maine-cannabis-regulations">Regulations</a>
            <a href="/guides/maine-cannabis-taxes-2026">280E Taxation</a>
            <a href="/guides/maine-cannabis-banking-solutions">Banking Solutions</a>
            <a href="/guides/maine-cannabis-staffing-licensing">Employee Licensing</a>
            <a href="/guides/maine-cannabis-marketing-compliance">Marketing Compliance</a>
            <a href="/guides/maine-cannabis-events-2026">Cannabis Events</a>
